# The Infinity Art — environment

# Google Gemini API key for the "Ask the Studio" assistant (/api/chat).
# Server-only — never exposed to the browser. Get one at
# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Without it the assistant fails gracefully to the WhatsApp handoff.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Google Apps Script web-app URL for conversation logging (Sessions +
# Messages tabs in one Google Sheet). Server-only. See
# docs/google-sheets-logging.md for the one-time setup.
# Optional — if unset, the chat works exactly as before and simply logs
# nothing. Logging never blocks or breaks an AI response.
GOOGLE_SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL=
